sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Marketing Team User
    participant FE as InaccurateAnalysisDialog<br/>«view»
    participant FC as FeedbackController<br/>«controller»
    participant FS as FeedbackService<br/>«service»
    participant ReR as ReviewRepository<br/>«repository»
    participant FR as FeedbackRepository<br/>«repository»

    U->>FE: open post detail, click "Inaccurate Analysis"
    U->>FE: type brief (5–1000 chars), submit
    FE->>FC: POST /api/reviews/{reviewId}/feedback { brief }
    FC->>FS: submitFeedback(reviewId, brief)
    FS->>ReR: findById(reviewId)
    FS->>FR: findByUserAndReview(userId, reviewId)
    alt feedback exists
        FS->>FR: update(brief)
    else first time
        FS->>FR: save(new Feedback)
    end
    FR-->>FS: Feedback
    FS-->>FC: FeedbackResponse
    FC-->>FE: 200 OK
    FE-->>U: "Thanks for the feedback"
